{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgksEPxa139JYfhy5FFq1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**What I decided:** a קרן כספית looks like the right place to park money I might need soon. I'm fairly sure. What decided it was one box: my עו\"ש pays \"0%\", and next to it \"קרן כספית יומית\" shows \"3.25%\" with an \"ביום מסחר\" tag (so I get the money back the next trading day). There was also the line \"הריבית הגבוהה ביותר שמחזירה את הכסף בזמן: קרן כספית יומית, 3.25% בשנה.\" That clicked. The other big number was the 1.8% one-year deposit, and that one locks you in for 12 months. What it costs I still don't know. The page says it's a yearly percent called דמי ניהול, but I never saw an actual number, let alone a shekel amount.\n\n**What it is, as far as I got:** the line under the heading says it's a fund that only puts money into short, low-risk stuff, \"כמו מק\"מ ופיקדונות\". Under \"למה משתמשים בזה\" the first line was \"כסף שצריך להישאר זמין: קרן חירום…\", and that's exactly my case.\n\n**Where I looked, in order:**\n- Top screen: the heading \"קרן כספית\", the line under it, the first lines of \"מה זה\". The rest was a wall of text, so I skimmed it. I caught \"דמי הניהול\" and something about 0.1%, but not what the 0.1% was for.\n- \"למה משתמשים בזה\": first lines only.\n- The comparison box with the coloured bars. That's where it clicked.\n- I scrolled past \"שווה לדעת\" and \"מי מציע ומי מפקח\".\n- \"כסף נכנס ויוצא\": I just saw the big \"בכל יום מסחר\".\n- \"כמה זה עולה\": a table with no numbers in it at all, just \"אין תקרה בחוק\" over and over and codes like MF-16. Useless to me.\n- I scrolled past \"מיסוי\" and only took in the big \"אין מס בזמן ההחזקה\". I skimmed \"סיכונים\".\n- Skipped \"מה האתר לקח בחשבון\" and the \"מונחים\" table.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** נאמן, מק\"מ, דמי משמרת, שכר נאמן, עמלת הפצה, מפיץ, השעה היעודה, הרווח הריאלי / הנומינלי, קרן נאמנות פטורה / חייבת, and those codes like MF-11, BANK-18, TXS-24.\n\n**Where it went wrong:**\n- I'm not sure the 3.25% is what I'd actually get. It says \"לפי ריבית בנק ישראל\", and there was a little grey line under the box that I didn't read.\n- The cost section is where I'd have given up. I wanted a number and got \"אין תקרה בחוק\".\n- There was a \"שחקו עם המספרים שלכם\" fold that might have shown my amount, but I didn't open it.\n- The page never tells me which fund to pick or where to click. My guess is the first step is to buy it through the bank's app, but nothing there actually says so."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":428,"cache_read_input_tokens":18618,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":428},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6f69276-92d3-458a-9415-6ad85f7ea055","uuid":"53ea0e3f-23b0-4097-8177-7ba481716802","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:14:23.236Z","request_id":"req_011CgksEPkukwqQQS58CWwcC"}
